WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:39.847 --> 01:47.064
=Episode 13=
(As Long As It Still Rains in Qingyi)

02:19.751 --> 02:20.751
(GuGu: I'm leaving.)

02:21.070 --> 02:22.070
(Won't you see me off?)

02:22.191 --> 02:23.191
You reply for me.

02:26.430 --> 02:27.430
What to say?

02:27.831 --> 02:29.030
"Busy with my girlfriend.

02:29.231 --> 02:30.231
Take a taxi yourself."

02:30.711 --> 02:31.711
Okay.

02:31.831 --> 02:32.831
Just reply.

02:33.271 --> 02:34.112
You go see her off.

02:34.192 --> 02:36.110
Who knows when you'll meet next time?

02:37.150 --> 02:38.150
Aren't you jealous?

02:39.070 --> 02:40.070
Hurry up and go.

02:41.990 --> 02:42.990
Pause.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.390
Okay.

02:44.470 --> 02:45.470
Wait until I come back.

02:52.191 --> 02:53.191
I've gotten you a taxi.

02:55.110 --> 02:56.110
Chen Luzhou.

03:00.030 --> 03:01.231
If it were someone else,

03:01.990 --> 03:03.391
I wouldn't give up so easily.

03:04.990 --> 03:06.231
But losing to Xu Zhi,

03:07.110 --> 03:08.110
I'm completely convinced.

03:09.990 --> 03:11.711
But if one day she dumps you,

03:12.671 --> 03:14.311
and if I still like you at that time,

03:15.311 --> 03:16.311
I will pursue you again.

03:20.950 --> 03:23.470
Actually, you don't need
to focus all your attention on me.

03:25.191 --> 03:26.871
Acting must be quite hard.

03:27.831 --> 03:29.351
You start work at 5 AM every day

03:29.911 --> 03:30.990
and often stay up late.

03:31.391 --> 03:32.391
You must be very tired.

03:34.630 --> 03:35.831
I hope you keep it up

03:36.271 --> 03:37.271
and do a good job acting.

03:38.070 --> 03:39.831
Maybe you can
go to a European film festival

03:39.911 --> 03:41.030
and win an award someday,

03:42.351 --> 03:43.351
making our country proud.

03:44.990 --> 03:46.430
I'll be there to cheer for you.

03:48.791 --> 03:49.311
Alright.

03:49.711 --> 03:50.711
See you there.

03:56.311 --> 03:57.311
I'm leaving.

04:27.470 --> 04:28.671
What are you looking for?

04:28.751 --> 04:29.990
Where's my hair tie?

04:30.351 --> 04:30.950
I left it here.

04:31.030 --> 04:32.030
I can't find it.

04:32.430 --> 04:33.191
Stop looking.

04:33.311 --> 04:34.311
Just buy a dozen later.

04:34.751 --> 04:35.751
A dozen?

04:35.950 --> 04:37.430
A dozen beers?

04:38.351 --> 04:39.350
I'll go buy them.

04:39.430 --> 04:40.430
No problem.

04:40.751 --> 04:42.110
Where's Gu Yan?

04:42.791 --> 04:43.791
She left.

04:44.871 --> 04:45.871
It's meal time?

04:47.470 --> 04:48.550
Now I feel hungry too.

04:50.470 --> 04:51.111
Go eat skewers.

04:51.191 --> 04:52.191
What?

04:52.470 --> 04:53.391
Skewers? Let's go.

04:53.471 --> 04:54.990
Why eat skewers so late at night?

04:55.630 --> 04:56.630
Let's go.

04:58.711 --> 04:59.711
Hurry up.

05:00.271 --> 05:01.271
Are we going?

05:01.630 --> 05:02.630
You decide.

05:08.007 --> 05:10.104
(Dan's Snack)

05:11.070 --> 05:12.070
Coming up.

05:12.150 --> 05:13.150
Coming up.

05:13.590 --> 05:15.191
Call me if you need more. Done.

05:15.271 --> 05:16.271
This one's good.

05:17.630 --> 05:18.630
It's their specialty.

05:20.231 --> 05:21.030
Try this one.

05:21.231 --> 05:21.950
Can you reach it?

05:22.110 --> 05:23.110
Sorry to interrupt.

05:23.550 --> 05:24.590
Please lift your feet.

05:26.871 --> 05:27.871
Thank you.

05:28.191 --> 05:29.751
Eat, don't just watch.

05:29.911 --> 05:31.150
Excuse me, guys.

05:31.630 --> 05:32.391
Tonight,

05:32.590 --> 05:34.351
we're staying open just for you.

05:34.630 --> 05:35.671
Enjoy yourselves.

05:35.751 --> 05:36.871
Eat well and drink well.

05:36.990 --> 05:37.590
- Okay.
- Okay.

05:37.751 --> 05:39.151
But there's one important thing.

05:39.231 --> 05:40.231
Come on.

05:41.391 --> 05:43.271
Remember to pay Dan.

05:43.351 --> 05:44.030
Go to him.

05:44.110 --> 05:44.752
I'll go to you.

05:44.832 --> 05:45.831
Ask him to pay.

05:45.911 --> 05:46.631
- No problem.
- I'll find you

05:46.711 --> 05:47.231
later.

05:47.391 --> 05:47.951
Go ahead.

05:48.031 --> 05:49.191
- Continue to eat.
- Take your time.

05:49.751 --> 05:50.911
Come on, let's toast.

05:51.231 --> 05:52.191
Come on.

05:52.271 --> 05:53.271
Cheers.

05:53.630 --> 05:54.191
Cheers.

05:54.271 --> 05:55.271
Cheers.

05:59.271 --> 06:00.071
As a city,

06:00.151 --> 06:02.351
Qingyi is both big and small.

06:02.711 --> 06:03.910
Us becoming friends

06:03.990 --> 06:05.271
is destined fate.

06:05.831 --> 06:07.311
We'll be going our separate ways.

06:07.911 --> 06:10.550
We wonder when we'll gather next time.

06:11.791 --> 06:12.751
How about this?

06:12.831 --> 06:14.630
Let's all say a few words.

06:14.831 --> 06:15.831
Say something.

06:16.070 --> 06:17.070
Okay.

06:17.911 --> 06:18.911
I'll go first.

06:19.231 --> 06:21.110
I wish our great artist Zhu

06:21.550 --> 06:23.990
to sell a painting for a million.

06:25.550 --> 06:26.550
- Did you all hear that?
- A million.

06:26.950 --> 06:28.110
Great!

06:28.391 --> 06:28.911
Nice.

06:29.030 --> 06:30.030
In that case,

06:30.630 --> 06:31.431
I wish you

06:31.511 --> 06:34.030
to sit at home and have windfall profits
fall from the sky.

06:34.110 --> 06:34.791
Sounds great?

06:35.030 --> 06:36.030
Not bad at all.

06:36.150 --> 06:37.311
Finally, something nice said.

06:37.391 --> 06:38.391
Get lost.

06:39.311 --> 06:40.711
Then I'll say something.

06:42.311 --> 06:45.070
I wish everyone could find that person

06:45.751 --> 06:47.150
who understands you.

06:49.590 --> 06:50.590
This is indeed hard.

06:51.871 --> 06:55.271
Selling a painting for a million

06:55.430 --> 06:56.871
is possible.

06:57.070 --> 06:58.070
Right?

06:58.351 --> 06:59.550
But to really find someone

06:59.630 --> 07:01.070
who understands you

07:02.751 --> 07:03.831
depends on fate.

07:04.751 --> 07:06.030
Some people with good luck

07:06.110 --> 07:07.231
may run into the right one.

07:08.311 --> 07:10.191
Some people with bad luck

07:10.430 --> 07:12.150
may not meet the one in their lifetime.

07:12.231 --> 07:13.510
Don't you agree, Lucy?

07:16.470 --> 07:18.231
But Dan seems
to understand you quite well.

07:18.510 --> 07:20.271
At your gesture,
he comes over to tidy up.

07:20.630 --> 07:22.231
Seeing him sweep, you lift your feet.

07:22.311 --> 07:23.311
You have great rapport.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.110
Alright.

07:26.311 --> 07:27.430
Then can you say something?

07:27.510 --> 07:28.470
You said nothing.

07:28.550 --> 07:29.191
I already did.

07:29.271 --> 07:29.950
Say more.

07:30.191 --> 07:31.191
Alright.

07:34.550 --> 07:36.231
Lucy once told me

07:36.871 --> 07:38.150
that we boys

07:38.630 --> 07:40.191
should have a spirit in our hearts.

07:41.271 --> 07:42.271
This spirit

07:42.510 --> 07:44.751
cannot be killed by either wind or rain.

07:45.671 --> 07:47.271
Even if the fuel runs out,

07:47.630 --> 07:49.351
as long as the embers still smolder

07:49.510 --> 07:50.630
and there is light,

07:51.271 --> 07:51.911
we can

07:52.150 --> 07:53.791
reignite hope.

07:54.590 --> 07:56.271
This is for all the boys present.

07:57.150 --> 07:58.510
- Come on.
- Come on.

07:58.590 --> 08:00.150
In the future, when we are not around,

08:00.550 --> 08:02.070
don't cry when things happen.

08:03.271 --> 08:04.390
We need to be tough.

08:04.470 --> 08:05.510
Say that to yourself.

08:05.590 --> 08:06.350
Control yourself.

08:06.430 --> 08:07.390
Me?

08:07.470 --> 08:08.470
Don't talk nonsense.

08:08.711 --> 08:09.231
Zhi,

08:09.711 --> 08:11.510
as the only girl here,

08:11.630 --> 08:12.791
say something too.

08:13.711 --> 08:14.791
Then I hope

08:15.110 --> 08:17.070
we girls can aspire to greater heights.

08:17.270 --> 08:18.950
After all,
beneath our feet is a vast land.

08:19.270 --> 08:20.270
There are many places

08:20.350 --> 08:21.471
we haven't been to.

08:27.591 --> 08:28.591
Come on.

08:30.390 --> 08:31.070
Lucy,

08:31.350 --> 08:32.350
would you like

08:32.471 --> 08:33.471
to make the finale?

08:36.911 --> 08:37.870
Then

08:37.950 --> 08:40.471
I will quote what Mr. Liang Qichao said.

08:43.230 --> 08:45.190
There are endless ages.
There are vast lands.

08:46.150 --> 08:47.150
The future is like a sea.

08:47.831 --> 08:48.831
There's a long way to go.

08:52.511 --> 08:53.711
There's a long way to go.

08:54.390 --> 08:54.990
Come on.

08:55.070 --> 08:56.070
- Come on.
- Come on.

08:56.390 --> 08:59.310
- To the future like a sea.
- To the future like a sea.

08:59.631 --> 09:01.950
- To the long way ahead.
- To the long way ahead.

09:02.110 --> 09:03.110
Cheers.

09:13.871 --> 09:15.350
Alright, this is where I see you off.

09:16.230 --> 09:16.791
I'm leaving.

09:17.190 --> 09:17.831
Bye-bye.

09:17.911 --> 09:18.511
Keep in touch.

09:18.591 --> 09:19.591
Sure. Bye-bye.

09:49.110 --> 09:50.110
(Notice of Lost Dog, Lucy)
Chen Luzhou.

09:51.631 --> 09:52.671
You got lost.

09:54.990 --> 09:56.791
The name Lucy is very common.

09:57.511 --> 09:58.751
I once met a girl

09:58.831 --> 10:00.110
who named her car Lucy.

10:01.350 --> 10:03.471
Shouldn't you change your name

10:04.110 --> 10:05.390
to Lu-Lu-Lucy.

10:06.070 --> 10:07.751
This way no one will have the same name.

10:08.150 --> 10:09.591
People might think you stutter.

10:11.270 --> 10:12.591
Lu-Lu-Lucy.

10:15.471 --> 10:16.471
Xu Zhi.

10:21.310 --> 10:22.310
Qingyi is so small.

10:22.631 --> 10:24.431
Should we act as strangers
if we meet again?

10:27.070 --> 10:28.310
Qingyi is not small.

10:28.511 --> 10:30.190
We've lived here
for more than ten years.

10:30.270 --> 10:31.230
It seems we haven't met

10:31.310 --> 10:32.831
besides the first year in high school.

10:33.030 --> 10:34.230
And you don't know at all.

10:36.671 --> 10:38.350
Then how do you know we haven't met?

10:43.471 --> 10:44.950
I need to think back carefully.

10:45.350 --> 10:46.950
After all, I felt so special

10:47.270 --> 10:48.471
when first seeing you.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.390
Do you think

11:01.751 --> 11:03.350
money can buy happiness?

11:04.831 --> 11:05.911
I don't know about others.

11:06.190 --> 11:08.030
You probably
will trade happiness for money.

11:09.990 --> 11:11.431
You know me so well.

11:12.431 --> 11:13.431
Likewise.

11:18.040 --> 11:24.707
♪Like a breeze,
drifting through the sky♪

11:25.177 --> 11:30.296
♪It wipes away
the trails of sorrow's sigh♪

11:32.152 --> 11:35.110
♪How many sceneries have I passed by♪

11:35.190 --> 11:36.190
Wait.

11:39.175 --> 11:42.950
♪Waiting for an encounter♪

11:43.030 --> 11:44.310
Want to watch the sunrise?

11:45.063 --> 11:47.911
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

11:48.312 --> 11:51.378
♪The moment I hug you♪

11:51.623 --> 11:58.488
♪The deeper memories are clearer♪

12:00.935 --> 12:04.022
♪Even if it rains on you♪

12:04.250 --> 12:07.647
♪I will always be with you♪

12:08.711 --> 12:12.063
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

12:12.263 --> 12:14.804
♪Our love will last♪

12:14.919 --> 12:18.074
♪Even if it rains on you♪

12:18.343 --> 12:22.424
♪I will always be with you♪

12:22.663 --> 12:25.522
♪I will let you know♪

12:26.058 --> 12:29.624
♪You're the only one♪

12:29.720 --> 12:32.142
♪When the rain blurs the world♪

12:34.070 --> 12:35.350
This is it.

12:37.319 --> 12:38.103
Yes.

12:40.024 --> 12:41.270
♪The splendid, sunny memories♪

12:41.350 --> 12:42.350
You are absolutely right.

12:43.471 --> 12:44.471
You are so excellent.

12:45.150 --> 12:46.190
Set higher standards.

12:47.711 --> 12:49.070
Not just anyone can pursue you.

12:49.791 --> 12:50.990
When getting a new boyfriend,

12:51.070 --> 12:52.551
he should at least meet my standards.

12:59.711 --> 13:01.150
Let's move forward for now.

13:10.671 --> 13:11.671
Then...

13:12.511 --> 13:13.511
Goodbye.

13:17.543 --> 13:20.698
♪Even if it rains on you♪

13:20.967 --> 13:25.048
♪I will always be with you♪

13:25.471 --> 13:26.471
Xu Zhi.

13:26.723 --> 13:28.568
♪I will let you know♪

13:28.682 --> 13:32.248
♪You're the only one♪

13:34.150 --> 13:35.150
Can I have a hug?

13:45.959 --> 13:52.007
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

13:52.935 --> 13:55.644
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

13:56.489 --> 14:01.031
♪A brilliant scenery♪

14:01.735 --> 14:07.509
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

14:08.340 --> 14:16.487
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

14:18.023 --> 14:23.557
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

14:25.607 --> 14:31.777
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

14:33.511 --> 14:36.615
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

14:37.031 --> 14:41.076
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

14:41.767 --> 14:45.751
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

14:46.119 --> 14:52.312
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

15:29.471 --> 15:30.471
Come and pack up.

16:03.190 --> 16:04.111
If you keep doing this,

16:04.191 --> 16:05.711
I won't have to cook anymore.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.551
Anyway, you only eat plain rice.

16:14.431 --> 16:15.511
You're so absent-minded.

16:16.431 --> 16:17.911
He won't leave for a few days.

16:19.070 --> 16:20.310
If you really miss him,

16:22.070 --> 16:23.070
go see him.

16:24.150 --> 16:25.591
We've all said goodbye in advance.

16:29.190 --> 16:30.190
And he can also

16:30.471 --> 16:31.871
hold back and not come to you?

16:32.511 --> 16:34.591
He might have some formalities to handle

16:34.871 --> 16:36.150
and not have enough time.

16:38.751 --> 16:40.270
Then if you really miss him later,

16:40.631 --> 16:41.791
I can fly to Europe with you.

16:48.350 --> 16:49.310
I'm going to Beijing.

16:49.390 --> 16:50.671
Why would I still miss him?

16:52.911 --> 16:53.911
That's true.

16:55.911 --> 16:57.671
Once you're in the college in Beijing,

16:59.631 --> 17:01.150
you might meet someone better.

17:01.950 --> 17:03.511
I think Chen Luzhou is just average.

17:03.791 --> 17:05.671
There are tons of people

17:05.751 --> 17:06.751
far better than him.

17:06.871 --> 17:07.871
He's not the only choice.

17:10.871 --> 17:12.831
When we finish eating,

17:12.990 --> 17:14.431
go to the market

17:14.671 --> 17:16.791
and buy some moxa sticks
to send to Grandma.

17:32.647 --> 17:34.616
(Billiards)

17:44.190 --> 17:46.030
It's not even dark yet,
and you started crying?

17:46.791 --> 17:48.390
Chen Luzhou is simply going abroad.

17:48.751 --> 17:49.990
Don't act like it's a breakup.

17:50.110 --> 17:51.511
I'm not crying at all.

17:51.631 --> 17:52.631
No.

17:55.791 --> 17:56.910
It's just that

17:56.990 --> 17:58.351
Lucy is going abroad for so long.

17:58.431 --> 17:59.511
I wonder when he'll return.

17:59.671 --> 18:00.911
I'll be doing everything alone.

18:01.751 --> 18:02.871
I better get used to it.

18:03.230 --> 18:04.431
Don't be so gloomy.

18:04.751 --> 18:06.070
Yes, Chen Luzhou will go abroad.

18:06.471 --> 18:07.471
But you still have me.

18:07.871 --> 18:08.551
Billiards?

18:08.871 --> 18:09.871
I'll play with you.

18:10.950 --> 18:11.990
Do you know how?

18:12.310 --> 18:13.310
Why wouldn't I know?

18:13.551 --> 18:14.551
Let me show you.

18:20.431 --> 18:21.431
Mr. Fu taught Xu Zhi

18:21.511 --> 18:23.390
and me billiards in elementary school.

18:23.511 --> 18:24.711
If my dad hadn't stopped me,

18:24.831 --> 18:26.831
I would have become a nine-ball pro.

18:27.990 --> 18:28.990
What are you waiting for?

18:29.070 --> 18:30.070
Set up the balls.

18:30.471 --> 18:32.591
The loser treats for milk tea.

18:33.431 --> 18:34.431
It's a deal.

19:25.575 --> 19:28.216
♪In the darkness, you're like fireworks♪

19:28.568 --> 19:31.240
♪Unattainable♪

19:31.320 --> 19:33.221
♪How much time is needed♪

19:34.360 --> 19:39.255
♪To vividly sketch♪

19:41.368 --> 19:44.258
♪Peel away the soft shell♪

19:44.344 --> 19:46.872
♪I want to understand your fragility♪

19:47.320 --> 19:49.912
♪The sky will have the morning sun♪

19:50.232 --> 19:53.912
♪And you always have me♪

19:54.616 --> 19:56.216
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

19:56.487 --> 19:59.160
♪Remains in the heart♪

19:59.544 --> 20:03.128
♪You'll realize
your long-desired dreams♪

20:03.527 --> 20:07.043
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

20:07.192 --> 20:09.760
♪Together with you♪

20:10.328 --> 20:11.976
♪Look, in this city♪

20:12.056 --> 20:14.840
♪It keeps raining♪

20:15.303 --> 20:17.016
♪Ticking and tattling♪

20:17.272 --> 20:19.096
♪Who is worried♪

20:19.256 --> 20:22.781
♪I believe
you can't find a reason either♪

20:23.064 --> 20:26.232
♪Don't give it an answer♪

20:26.791 --> 20:30.968
♪I'm the same♪

20:32.711 --> 20:34.270
Did you shave today?

20:42.151 --> 20:43.751
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

20:43.864 --> 20:46.695
♪Remains in the heart♪

20:46.823 --> 20:50.407
♪You'll realize
your long-desired dreams♪

20:50.806 --> 20:54.322
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

20:54.471 --> 20:57.039
♪Together with you♪

20:57.607 --> 20:59.480
♪Listen to the endless sound of cicadas♪

20:59.608 --> 21:02.119
♪In the midsummer♪

21:02.582 --> 21:04.295
♪The sequel of the story♪

21:04.551 --> 21:06.375
♪Has never ended♪

21:06.535 --> 21:10.060
♪I'll still be by your side♪

21:10.343 --> 21:13.511
♪Through all seasons♪

21:14.070 --> 21:15.615
♪Shall we go to the future♪

21:15.975 --> 21:16.975
Why are you here?

21:17.935 --> 21:19.575
I bought some moxa sticks
for my grandma.

21:20.015 --> 21:21.134
I happened to pass by here.

21:25.334 --> 21:26.494
I'm back to pack things up.

21:30.815 --> 21:31.815
Then I'm leaving.

21:32.815 --> 21:33.815
Bye-bye.

21:36.615 --> 21:37.615
Xu Zhi.

21:45.935 --> 21:46.935
What?

22:12.334 --> 22:13.334
Your shoelace is untied.

22:40.711 --> 22:43.671
♪On a midsummer night♪

22:44.583 --> 22:49.044
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

22:50.887 --> 22:54.119
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

22:54.887 --> 22:59.496
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

23:01.031 --> 23:03.414
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

23:03.591 --> 23:05.895
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

23:06.279 --> 23:08.419
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

23:08.499 --> 23:10.927
♪The whole world pauses♪

23:12.039 --> 23:14.457
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

23:16.676 --> 23:18.253
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

23:18.968 --> 23:21.798
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

23:21.889 --> 23:23.761
♪Falling into your eyes♪

23:24.167 --> 23:26.744
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

23:26.958 --> 23:28.583
♪Billions of raindrops♪

23:29.208 --> 23:32.055
♪Like the universe's response♪

23:32.135 --> 23:34.087
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

23:35.463 --> 23:43.512
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

23:44.856 --> 23:48.378
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

23:49.159 --> 23:56.952
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

24:05.735 --> 24:08.792
(2. Ear piercing; 10. Watch
the sunrise with someone you like)

24:41.639 --> 24:47.687
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

24:48.615 --> 24:51.324
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

24:52.169 --> 24:56.711
♪A brilliant scenery♪

24:57.415 --> 25:03.189
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

25:04.020 --> 25:12.167
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

25:13.703 --> 25:19.237
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

25:21.287 --> 25:27.457
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

25:28.975 --> 25:29.616
I already said.

25:29.696 --> 25:30.975
I'll handle it when I return.

25:33.174 --> 25:34.174
(Xu Zhi,)

25:34.655 --> 25:35.655
(the world is vast.)

25:36.695 --> 25:37.775
(Let's move forward.)

26:05.920 --> 26:11.544
♪Let moonlight reply instead of longing♪

26:11.736 --> 26:20.088
♪Turn the incomplete shadow into luck♪

26:21.240 --> 26:27.064
♪Crush, fulfilling the only greed♪

26:29.176 --> 26:35.576
♪Crush, the world shining
because of you♪

26:37.048 --> 26:40.056
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

26:40.216 --> 26:44.920
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

26:45.159 --> 26:49.128
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

26:49.397 --> 26:55.771
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

27:03.575 --> 27:05.294
Luzhou, where is this place?

27:05.494 --> 27:06.494
I want to go too.

27:06.935 --> 27:08.455
Stay at the hotel if you keep nagging

27:08.535 --> 27:09.575
and go nowhere.

27:11.094 --> 27:12.374
Then give me the iPad.

27:12.454 --> 27:13.454
I'll play games.

27:46.471 --> 27:50.904
(Because the puppy is wagging its tail!)

27:58.174 --> 28:00.294
(I hope in your days without me,)

28:00.535 --> 28:02.655
(your world will still shine brightly,)

28:03.214 --> 28:05.575
(teeming with flowers and applause.)

28:06.655 --> 28:08.414
(As long as it still rains in Qingyi)

28:08.735 --> 28:10.294
(and the puppy wags its tail,)

28:10.695 --> 28:12.054
(someone will always love you.)

28:17.720 --> 28:19.454
Because the puppy is wagging its tail.

28:19.975 --> 28:20.935
How many words?

28:21.015 --> 28:22.015
What does that mean?

28:23.015 --> 28:24.015
The literal meaning.

29:17.319 --> 29:27.064
(A month later, Ruicheng)

29:44.214 --> 29:45.214
Who is it?

29:52.094 --> 29:53.174
I want to sleep with you.

29:56.374 --> 29:57.855
Don't cling to me every day.

29:58.735 --> 29:59.895
Go back to your room.

30:01.775 --> 30:03.374
My room is next to Mom and Dad's.

30:03.815 --> 30:05.054
I hear them arguing every day.

30:05.775 --> 30:06.775
It's driving me crazy.

30:07.174 --> 30:08.174
So you come to bother me?

30:08.254 --> 30:08.775
That's right.

30:09.174 --> 30:10.174
By the way,

30:10.254 --> 30:12.054
where is the watermelon
Mom and Dad bought?

30:12.294 --> 30:13.294
It's in the fridge.

30:13.775 --> 30:14.775
I want to eat it.

30:34.895 --> 30:35.895
Why are you sighing?

30:36.454 --> 30:37.454
What now?

30:38.254 --> 30:40.254
Qian hasn't replied
to my messages for days.

30:41.855 --> 30:43.975
Why is she always so indifferent to me?

30:44.655 --> 30:45.815
You want relationship advice?

30:46.735 --> 30:47.735
Pay me 800 yuan.

30:48.535 --> 30:50.015
That's a robbery.

30:59.615 --> 31:00.615
Is it okay now?

31:01.935 --> 31:02.935
Come on.

31:10.294 --> 31:11.294
Is it sweet?

31:13.294 --> 31:14.294
Center is the sweetest.

31:14.414 --> 31:15.655
I want to eat the center part.

31:17.895 --> 31:19.094
Don't feed someone

31:19.895 --> 31:21.535
the whole watermelon at once.

31:22.575 --> 31:24.174
Once they've had the sweetest bite,

31:24.254 --> 31:25.575
they'll find the rest plain.

31:32.735 --> 31:33.775
What about yours?

31:34.015 --> 31:35.655
You gave your entire melon to Xu Zhi?

31:38.134 --> 31:39.134
Hurry up and eat.

31:39.254 --> 31:39.974
And then sleep.

31:40.054 --> 31:41.535
Otherwise, go back to your own room.

32:00.374 --> 32:01.374
Chen Luzhou.

33:41.815 --> 33:42.815
Xu Zhi.

33:47.174 --> 33:48.174
Can I have a hug?

34:40.743 --> 34:43.703
♪On a midsummer night♪

34:44.615 --> 34:49.076
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

34:50.919 --> 34:54.151
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

34:54.919 --> 34:59.528
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

35:01.063 --> 35:03.446
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

35:03.623 --> 35:05.927
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

35:06.311 --> 35:08.451
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

35:08.531 --> 35:10.959
♪The whole world pauses♪

35:12.071 --> 35:14.489
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

35:16.708 --> 35:18.285
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

35:19.375 --> 35:21.830
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

35:21.921 --> 35:23.793
♪Falling into your eyes♪

35:24.327 --> 35:26.776
♪Oh, oh, oh♪

35:26.990 --> 35:28.615
♪Billions of raindrops♪

35:29.575 --> 35:32.087
♪Like the universe's response♪

35:32.167 --> 35:33.816
(CLZ)

35:35.527 --> 35:43.416
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

35:55.334 --> 35:57.414
Y-You are really here.

35:58.054 --> 35:59.094
Just passing by.

35:59.655 --> 36:01.054
A cup of milk tea to greet you,

36:01.134 --> 36:02.895
the hardworking host.

36:03.214 --> 36:04.214
Thank you.

36:06.815 --> 36:07.414
What's wrong?

36:07.695 --> 36:09.334
So moved by a cup of milk tea?

36:12.254 --> 36:13.254
Dad.

36:15.374 --> 36:16.374
Hello, Sir.

36:18.655 --> 36:19.695
What is your name?

36:20.054 --> 36:21.054
Zhu Yangqi.

36:23.174 --> 36:24.294
So you're that "pig", huh?

36:24.655 --> 36:25.895
Alright, I...

36:25.975 --> 36:27.334
We'll talk about your issue later.

36:27.895 --> 36:28.895
Yingying,

36:29.015 --> 36:30.015
have you forgotten?

36:30.454 --> 36:32.855
Didn't you promise to focus on studying?

36:34.134 --> 36:34.896
Look at you now.

36:34.976 --> 36:36.294
You don't go home after class.

36:36.374 --> 36:37.775
What are you doing in the rain?

36:37.855 --> 36:38.975
Sir, don't misunderstand.

36:39.214 --> 36:40.615
She's been studying hard.

36:42.374 --> 36:43.374
You two...

36:44.054 --> 36:45.054
Are you...?

36:47.855 --> 36:48.695
Are you?

36:48.775 --> 36:49.775
Yes!

36:51.374 --> 36:52.855
We're dating.

36:52.935 --> 36:54.174
It's been more than a year.

36:54.334 --> 36:54.935
Satisfied?

36:55.015 --> 36:56.015
You...

36:56.815 --> 36:57.815
Cut the nonsense.

36:58.494 --> 36:59.494
I... You...

36:59.695 --> 37:01.895
Sir, you've misunderstood Yingying.

37:01.975 --> 37:03.054
She was speaking in anger.

37:03.454 --> 37:04.935
We've only met two months ago.

37:05.094 --> 37:06.094
There's nothing.

37:07.855 --> 37:09.735
Zhu... Zhu...

37:09.855 --> 37:10.575
Yangqi.

37:10.695 --> 37:11.695
Yangqi.

37:12.775 --> 37:14.414
I have been your age too.

37:14.815 --> 37:16.615
You're in the rain, sharing an umbrella.

37:16.895 --> 37:17.895
And the milk tea?

37:18.174 --> 37:19.174
Don't think I don't know

37:19.294 --> 37:20.294
what you are doing.

37:20.775 --> 37:21.775
Tell me the truth.

37:22.655 --> 37:23.655
To what extent

37:24.294 --> 37:25.414
have you two reached?

37:27.655 --> 37:28.655
I admit.

37:29.094 --> 37:30.094
I do like her.

37:31.414 --> 37:32.214
But I can swear.

37:32.334 --> 37:33.334
She knows nothing.

37:33.935 --> 37:35.414
Because even I am not sure

37:35.655 --> 37:36.855
my feelings are real.

37:38.015 --> 37:39.655
I planned to tell her only when she

37:39.735 --> 37:40.735
gets admitted

37:41.334 --> 37:42.334
to a college in Beijing.

37:42.895 --> 37:45.015
I was afraid
she'd overthink and be affected.

37:46.494 --> 37:47.494
So, Sir,

37:47.975 --> 37:49.414
you really misunderstood Yingying.

37:51.015 --> 37:52.015
Yingying,

37:52.815 --> 37:53.895
did he

37:54.575 --> 37:55.775
tell the truth?

38:01.294 --> 38:02.454
I'm asking you.

38:07.134 --> 38:09.735
You... and you... you two...

38:10.695 --> 38:11.695
Yingying!

38:11.975 --> 38:12.975
It's raining, Yingying.

38:13.134 --> 38:14.535
Don't make me worry.

38:14.975 --> 38:16.174
It's raining, Yingying.

38:32.975 --> 38:34.695
I think that boy definitely

38:34.775 --> 38:36.454
got something with Yingying.

38:37.214 --> 38:38.214
Don't talk nonsense.

38:38.975 --> 38:40.374
Yingying doesn't fancy him at all.

38:42.374 --> 38:44.535
If she doesn't fancy him,
why are you sulking here?

38:44.735 --> 38:46.975
If you ask me, just apologize to her.

38:47.334 --> 38:49.294
Everything will be fine
if you talk it out.

38:49.815 --> 38:50.815
I won't apologize.

38:51.054 --> 38:52.414
She's the one ignoring me.

38:53.615 --> 38:54.895
Mr. Cai,

38:56.815 --> 38:58.015
make use of your mouth.

38:58.254 --> 39:00.174
Aren't you quite talkative
in the hospital?

39:02.214 --> 39:04.655
What does this have to do
with being talkative?

39:05.775 --> 39:07.935
It was always me apologizing
since she was little.

39:08.015 --> 39:09.015
I won't this time.

39:09.214 --> 39:10.294
She annoyed me on purpose.

39:13.815 --> 39:14.895
Look at this garlic.

39:15.494 --> 39:17.655
The older it gets, the thinner its skin.

39:18.015 --> 39:19.575
Look. You have to...

39:21.174 --> 39:22.174
Smash it.

39:22.454 --> 39:24.134
It's settled down, see?

39:24.214 --> 39:25.334
Look at the skin.

39:26.294 --> 39:28.975
Layer by layer.

39:35.975 --> 39:37.735
- Look.
- So I'm garlic?

39:37.815 --> 39:38.815
I guess so.

39:43.494 --> 39:44.855
Still mad at your dad, huh?

39:46.015 --> 39:47.735
I don't have time for him.

39:49.174 --> 39:50.815
Then is it because of Zhu Yangqi?

40:00.535 --> 40:02.254
Lucy, are you still my good buddy?

40:02.535 --> 40:03.456
When you're in trouble,

40:03.536 --> 40:04.655
I'm always by your side,

40:04.735 --> 40:05.815
giving you advice.

40:05.895 --> 40:07.494
And now you just disappear, huh?

40:07.855 --> 40:08.855
Get back to me quickly.

40:19.174 --> 40:20.615
Buddha, bless me.

40:21.015 --> 40:22.254
Don't let last night's incident

40:22.334 --> 40:23.775
harm my relationship with Yingying.

40:24.615 --> 40:25.975
Buddha, bless me.

40:50.494 --> 40:51.494
Yingying,

40:52.174 --> 40:54.054
I'm going to Beijing today at 4 PM.

40:54.575 --> 40:56.214
Good luck. See you in Beijing.

41:03.254 --> 41:04.254
What's wrong?

41:04.494 --> 41:05.494
You startled me.

41:07.374 --> 41:08.374
Yingying,

41:08.935 --> 41:10.775
I'm going to Beijing today at 4 PM.

41:11.414 --> 41:12.895
Good luck. See you in Beijing.

41:13.935 --> 41:14.935
Won't you see him off?

41:15.414 --> 41:17.014
A-Absolutely not.

41:17.094 --> 41:18.134
I've seen him as a buddy.

41:19.134 --> 41:21.054
I played billiards with him out of pity.

41:21.214 --> 41:23.174
And he wants to be my boyfriend?

41:23.254 --> 41:24.214
It's awkward to see him.

41:24.294 --> 41:25.414
So you just won't see him?

41:25.695 --> 41:26.655
When you go to Beijing,

41:26.735 --> 41:27.935
you'll never see him again?

41:28.054 --> 41:29.134
It's not to that extent.

41:30.294 --> 41:33.174
Sometimes he's quite cheeky.

41:33.374 --> 41:35.134
But overall, he's not bad.

41:38.134 --> 41:39.134
Isn't that enough?

41:39.254 --> 41:40.495
No need to stop being friends

41:40.575 --> 41:41.575
because he likes you.

41:43.855 --> 41:44.855
Fair point.

41:45.374 --> 41:47.254
I am pretty and kind-hearted.

41:47.334 --> 41:48.535
Many boys like me.

41:48.615 --> 41:50.094
Zhu Yangqi is just another one.

41:51.015 --> 41:52.414
Alright.

41:56.294 --> 41:57.334
He likes me. That's all.

41:57.414 --> 41:58.494
He won't eat me anyway.

41:58.815 --> 41:59.815
I have nothing to fear.

42:00.054 --> 42:01.054
I'll see him off.

42:12.615 --> 42:13.615
Zhu Yangqi!

42:14.935 --> 42:15.935
Yingying.

42:19.294 --> 42:20.855
I thought you'd never see me again.

42:21.655 --> 42:23.495
After all, you did help me a lot.

42:23.575 --> 42:25.015
It's only right that I see you off.

42:28.895 --> 42:29.895
This is for you.

42:31.855 --> 42:34.134
It isn't a love letter, is it?

42:34.975 --> 42:36.254
Don't be so cheesy.

42:36.334 --> 42:38.174
Or we might not even
be able to be friends.

42:38.374 --> 42:39.615
What are you thinking?

42:39.695 --> 42:42.655
Here, this is the art exam study guide
I organized for you.

42:45.174 --> 42:46.174
Take a look.

42:47.335 --> 42:48.792
(To Cai Yingying)

42:49.063 --> 42:54.424
(Art Exam Study Guide)

42:58.374 --> 42:59.374
Well,

42:59.615 --> 43:00.815
don't take what I said to you

43:00.895 --> 43:01.895
that day to heart.

43:03.015 --> 43:04.494
Liking you is my own business.

43:04.975 --> 43:05.975
Don't feel burdened.

43:07.174 --> 43:08.134
Besides,

43:08.214 --> 43:09.414
once I'm in Beijing,

43:09.615 --> 43:11.134
I might fall for someone else soon.

43:12.174 --> 43:14.254
That would really be a relief.

43:23.775 --> 43:25.094
The driver is waiting for me.

43:25.655 --> 43:26.655
I need to go.

43:27.414 --> 43:29.334
I'm very glad
that you came to see me off.

43:35.015 --> 43:36.015
Let me walk with you.

43:37.927 --> 43:42.520
(Taxi)

43:44.254 --> 43:45.254
Let's stop here.

43:45.535 --> 43:46.535
Hurry back.

43:51.414 --> 43:52.414
Keep it up.

43:53.414 --> 43:54.414
Keep it up.

43:55.134 --> 43:56.134
I'm off now.

43:57.974 --> 44:00.056
♪Can beat the night♪

44:00.216 --> 44:04.069
♪We can outrun time♪

44:04.358 --> 44:07.896
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

44:08.184 --> 44:12.521
♪All blend into our season♪

44:17.214 --> 44:18.174
I'm off.

44:18.254 --> 44:19.855
Study well and keep it up.

44:22.279 --> 44:24.604
♪When the summer breeze blows♪

44:25.294 --> 44:26.374
(Cai Yingying: I will.)

44:27.695 --> 44:28.695
(See you in Beijing.)

44:28.807 --> 44:30.615
♪No fallen leaves,
just the moment we keep♪

44:31.695 --> 44:34.935
♪With you, I actually
start looking forward to rainy days♪

44:35.015 --> 44:36.015
(I just woke up.)

44:36.334 --> 44:38.494
(Chen Xingqi insisted on sleeping
with me last night.)

44:38.775 --> 44:39.535
(He snored.)

44:39.615 --> 44:40.615
(I couldn't sleep well.)

44:41.374 --> 44:42.895
(What's wrong? Something urgent?)

44:44.015 --> 44:44.656
It's nothing.

44:44.736 --> 44:45.935
I'm doing well.

44:46.134 --> 44:47.134
On my way to Beijing.

44:48.294 --> 44:49.615
Do well abroad too.

44:50.254 --> 44:51.254
Don't make me worry.

44:51.655 --> 44:55.512
♪We can outrun time♪

44:55.672 --> 44:59.257
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

44:59.448 --> 45:02.680
♪All blend into our season♪

45:14.775 --> 45:15.294
Eat the soup.

45:15.775 --> 45:16.775
It will get cold soon.

45:19.015 --> 45:20.015
I'm almost full.

45:23.975 --> 45:24.975
Let's take a photo.

45:25.454 --> 45:26.454
- Okay.
- Look over here.

45:27.454 --> 45:28.454
Luzhou, move in a bit.

45:29.054 --> 45:30.054
You guys take the photo.

45:32.735 --> 45:33.735
Then let's take it.

45:33.975 --> 45:34.975
Let's take one ourselves.

45:36.775 --> 45:37.695
- Is it done?
- Yes.

45:38.094 --> 45:39.655
- How is it?
- It looks good.

45:42.735 --> 45:43.735
By the way, Dad.

45:44.174 --> 45:45.174
Didn't you say you'd

45:45.254 --> 45:46.655
buy me the limited edition Lego?

45:47.254 --> 45:48.134
The store we checked

45:48.214 --> 45:49.214
is about to close soon.

45:49.975 --> 45:50.975
If you're done, go now.

45:51.414 --> 45:52.015
Well, I...

45:52.095 --> 45:53.655
Hurry up. It'll close soon.

45:54.374 --> 45:55.374
What's the time now?

45:55.895 --> 45:56.695
It's past 4 PM.

45:56.815 --> 45:58.134
The malls here close early.

45:58.214 --> 45:59.294
How about we go now?

46:00.454 --> 46:01.736
- Go quickly.
- Stay put here.

46:01.816 --> 46:02.975
Luzhou, keep an eye on him.

46:03.414 --> 46:04.815
Don't run around, got it?

46:07.695 --> 46:08.695
Let's go.

46:18.935 --> 46:21.054
(When my grandma was sick,)

46:21.134 --> 46:23.775
(he was playing the violin
for her every day in the yard.)

46:24.214 --> 46:25.254
(When)

46:25.855 --> 46:27.334
we are both old,

46:27.815 --> 46:29.895
if we are still around,

46:30.655 --> 46:32.935
(play a tune for me,
and I'll tell you the answer.)

47:11.767 --> 47:14.599
(I hope in your days without me,)

47:15.099 --> 47:18.184
(your world will still shine brightly,)

47:18.264 --> 47:24.751
(teeming with flowers and applause.)

47:25.385 --> 47:31.201
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

47:31.753 --> 47:37.281
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

47:38.793 --> 47:43.241
♪The world is too quiet♪

47:44.233 --> 47:51.161
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

47:52.073 --> 47:57.161
♪Who will visit me♪

47:58.217 --> 48:03.841
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

48:04.585 --> 48:07.641
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

48:07.881 --> 48:13.201
♪Into concern and care♪

48:18.729 --> 48:23.841
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

48:24.361 --> 48:30.201
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

48:31.657 --> 48:35.041
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

48:35.177 --> 48:41.401
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:41.897 --> 48:44.841
♪The lonely clock♪

48:45.001 --> 48:49.601
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

48:49.993 --> 48:53.241
♪Are we both♪

48:53.513 --> 48:57.041
♪Attracted to each other♪

48:58.185 --> 49:04.801
♪Falling into you♪

49:08.521 --> 49:14.321
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

49:15.177 --> 49:17.841
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

49:18.377 --> 49:23.001
♪From reaching eternity♪

